---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Shape bookkeeping of DeepLOB (Zhang, Zohren & Roberts 2019). Widths: 40 -> 20 -> 10 -> 1 by
// two 1x2 convolutions with stride 1x2 and one 1x10 convolution; time length (100) never changes.
const maps = [
  { w: 40, en: '100 × 40', vi: '100 × 40', x: 20 },
  { w: 20, en: '100 × 20', vi: '100 × 20', x: 240 },
  { w: 10, en: '100 × 10', vi: '100 × 10', x: 390 },
  { w: 1, en: '100 × 1', vi: '100 × 1', x: 500 },
];
const S = 3.4; // px per column
---
<figure class="p15d">
  <div class="scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 300" role="img" aria-label="Shape of the data through DeepLOB. A 100 by 40 input passes a 1 by 2 convolution with stride 1 by 2 to become 100 by 20, again to become 100 by 10, then a 1 by 10 convolution to become 100 by 1. An Inception module with 32 filters follows, then an LSTM with 64 units, then three outputs: down, flat, up.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>DeepLOB: the width shrinks, the time axis stays</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>DeepLOB: bề ngang co lại, trục thời gian giữ nguyên</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="48" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>Each box is the data after one step. Height is 100 time steps in every box.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mỗi hộp là dữ liệu sau một bước. Chiều cao luôn là 100 bước thời gian.</tspan></text>

    {maps.map((m) => (
      <g>
        <rect x={m.x} y="80" width={Math.max(m.w * S, 5)} height="120" class="map" />
        <text x={m.x + Math.max(m.w * S, 5) / 2} y="222" text-anchor="middle" class="dim"><tspan data-lang-en>{m.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{m.vi}</tspan></text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x="198" y="104" text-anchor="middle" class="op">1×2</text>
    <text x="198" y="118" text-anchor="middle" class="op">stride 1×2</text>
    <polygon points="162,132 190,132 190,127 202,136 190,145 190,140 162,140" class="arrow" />
    <text x="349" y="104" text-anchor="middle" class="op">1×2</text>
    <text x="349" y="118" text-anchor="middle" class="op">stride 1×2</text>
    <polygon points="314,132 340,132 340,127 352,136 340,145 340,140 314,140" class="arrow" />
    <text x="462" y="118" text-anchor="middle" class="op">1×10</text>
    <polygon points="430,132 452,132 452,127 464,136 452,145 452,140 430,140" class="arrow" />

    <polygon points="512,132 530,132 530,126 540,136 530,146 530,140 512,140" class="arrow" />
    <rect x="546" y="94" width="104" height="84" rx="6" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="parallel" x="597" y="118" size="22" />
    <text x="597" y="152" text-anchor="middle" class="bt">Inception</text>
    <text x="597" y="168" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>32 filters</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>32 bộ lọc</tspan></text>

    <polygon points="652,132 672,132 672,126 684,136 672,146 672,140 652,140" class="arrow" />
    <rect x="690" y="94" width="84" height="84" rx="6" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="loop" x="732" y="118" size="22" />
    <text x="732" y="152" text-anchor="middle" class="bt">LSTM</text>
    <text x="732" y="168" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>64 units</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>64 đơn vị</tspan></text>

    <polygon points="777,132 788,132 788,126 798,136 788,146 788,140 777,140" class="arrow" />
    <rect x="802" y="94" width="78" height="84" rx="6" class="box out" />
    <text x="841" y="124" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>down</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>giảm</tspan></text>
    <text x="841" y="141" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>flat</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đi ngang</tspan></text>
    <text x="841" y="158" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>up</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tăng</tspan></text>

    <text x="30" y="262" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>The first 1×2 filter reads (price, volume) pairs; the stride stops it from mixing one level's volume with the next level's price.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bộ lọc 1×2 đầu tiên đọc từng cặp (giá, khối lượng); stride giữ nó khỏi trộn khối lượng mức này với giá mức kế.</tspan></text>
    <text x="30" y="284" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>The LSTM then reads the 100 time steps in order and gives a single prediction.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>LSTM sau đó đọc 100 bước thời gian theo thứ tự và đưa ra một dự đoán.</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Shapes follow the paper: 40 → 20 → 10 → 1 columns, time length 100 kept by zero padding. The output is a three-way label (down, flat, up) for the price move over a chosen horizon.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Kích thước theo bài báo: 40 → 20 → 10 → 1 cột, độ dài thời gian 100 giữ nguyên nhờ zero padding. Đầu ra là nhãn ba lớp (giảm, đi ngang, tăng) cho biến động giá trong một khoảng nhìn trước đã chọn.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .p15d { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .p15d .scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .p15d svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .p15d text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .p15d .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p15d .sub, .p15d .note, .p15d .op { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p15d .op { font-size: 12px; }
  .p15d .map { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .p15d .dim { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }
  .p15d .arrow { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p15d .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .p15d .box.out { stroke: var(--gold-icon); }
  .p15d .bt { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p15d .bs { fill: var(--text); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .p15d figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
